(🇬🇧&amp;🇹🇷)

Price has reached the initial entry level. If you have any previous losses, you can close them.

In addition, I mentioned that the blue box could act as support. It has also seen an 11% reaction from there.

From the second entry, there is 20% profit.

I am following as mentioned in the update above.

Have a nice week.
