Fiyat ilk entry seviyesine gelmiş durumda. Daha önceden zararı olanlarınız varsa kapatabilirsiniz.

Bunun yanında mavi kutunun destek olarak çalışabileceğinden bahsetmiştim. Oradan da %11&#x27;lik bir reaksiyon almış durumda.

İkinci entry&#x27;den ise %20&#x27;lik bir kâr mevcut.

Ben üstte bahsettiğim güncellemedeki gibi ilerliyorum.

İyi haftalar dilerim.</span></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-md" style="aspect-ratio:1.856497175141243"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/1972591402686025848/photo/1"><img alt="" class="w-full" loading="eager" fetchPriority="high" width="3286" height="1770" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2ANSm3WYAAhQUq?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2ANSm3WYAAhQUq?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2ANSm3WYAAhQUq?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2ANSm3WYAAhQUq?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/Efloud/status/1972591402686025848/photo/1"></a></div></div><div hidden="" itemProp="image" itemScope="" itemType="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><meta content="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2ANSm3WYAAhQUq.jpg" itemProp="contentUrl"/><meta content="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2ANSm3WYAAhQUq.jpg" itemProp="url"/><meta content="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2ANSm3WYAAhQUq.jpg?format=jpg&amp;name=thumb" itemProp="thumbnailUrl"/><meta content="Efloud&#x27;s Image on X" itemProp="name"/><meta content="Image" itemProp="description"/><meta content="2025-09-29T09:16:54.000Z" itemProp="uploadDate"/><meta content="3286" itemProp="width"/><meta content="1770" itemProp="height"/></div><div class="shrink flex items-center text-gray-700 [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:content-[&#x27;·&#x27;] [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:px-1 [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:shrink-0"><span class="contents"><a id="_R_qhqipid4j6_" data-state="closed" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-gray-700 t