 | Update &amp; New Ideas\n(🇬🇧&amp;🇹🇷)\n\nCurrent Situation:\nIn my previous analyses, I highlighted two potential entry levels: $39.7 and $47.9. \nYou can see the notes on the chart.\n\nAt $47.9, I didn’t see a strong reaction, so I closed that position with a small profit https://t.co/WvJYtuGfNB",hashtag_entities:$R[190]={__refs:$R[191]=[]},cashtag_entities:$R[192]={__refs:$R[193]=["client:VHdlZXQ6MTk3MTk2MDIzMzAxMTM1NTg1Nw==:details:cashtag_entities:0"]},smarttags:$R[194]={__refs:$R[195]=[]}},"client:VHdlZXQ6MTk3MTk2MDIzMzAxMTM1NTg1Nw==:details:cashtag_entities:0":$R[196]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MTk3MTk2MDIzMzAxMTM1NTg1Nw==:details:cashtag_entities:0",__typename:"ApiTagEntity",indices:$R[197]=[0,5],tag:$R[198]={__ref:"U21hcnRUYWc6SFlQRQ=="},text:"HYPE"},"client:VHdlZXQ6MTk3MTk2MDIzMzAxMTM1NTg1Nw==:views":$R[199]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MTk3MTk2MDIzMzAxMTM1NTg1Nw==:views",__typename:"ViewCountInfo",count:"136578"},"client:VHdlZXQ6MTk3MTk2MDIzMzAxMTM1NTg1Nw==:note_tweet":$R[200]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MTk3MTk2MDIzMzAxMTM1NTg1Nw==:note_tweet",__typename:"NoteTweetData",is_expandable:!0,note_tweet_results:$R[201]={__ref:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoxOTcxOTYwMjMyNjI1NTQxMTIw"}},Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoxOTcxOTYwMjMyNjI1NTQxMTIw:$R[202]={__id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoxOTcxOTYwMjMyNjI1NTQxMTIw",__typename:"NoteTweetResults",result:$R[203]={__ref:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA="},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoxOTcxOTYwMjMyNjI1NTQxMTIw"},"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=":$R[204]={__id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=",__typename:"NoteTweet",text:"$HYPE | Update & New Ideas\n(🇬🇧&🇹🇷)\n\nCurrent Situation:\nIn my previous analyses, I highlighted two potential entry levels: $39.7 and $47.9. \nYou can see the notes on the chart.\n\nAt $47.9, I didn’t see a strong reaction, so I closed that position with a small profit (https://t.co/chWj43wSIP).\n\nHowever, since I didn’t share a direct update here at the time, I count it as a missed trade. And from that point, price is currently down 6%.\n\nFrom $39.7, price made a clean move upward. Now trading at 13.6% profit.\n\nAnyone who combined both strategies would currently be sitting on roughly 7.6% net profit.\nTo manage risk, you might consider taking profit and moving stops to entry.\n\nMy Actions:\nBecause I closed the first trade and re-entered at the second level and given that price is now approaching LTF resistance, I’m taking 50% profit and moving my stop to entry.\nAs long as the blue box holds, I see no issue with the remaining position.\n\nNew Ideas:\nIf price loses the channel, I’ll assume a loss of momentum.\nIn that case, as mentioned in my earlier analysis, the $28 zone is where I’d look for a fresh entry opportunity.\nIf the positive trend continues, I plan to finalize the position between $51 - $52.\n\nWishing everyone a great weekend and successful trades.\n-------------\n#HYPE | Güncelleme & Yeni Fikirler\n\nGüncel Durum:\nGeçtiğimiz analizlerde 2 farklı alım noktası söylemiştim. Bunlardan ilki $39.7, diğeri de $47.9'du.\n \n$47.9’a gelen fiyatta güzel reaksiyon göremeyince ufak bir kâr ile kapatmıştım (https://t.co/chWj43wSIP) lakin sizi direkt olarak ana mesaj ile bilgilendirmediğim için bunu bir kayıp olarak varsayıyorum. An itibariyle o noktadan %6 zarar mevcut.\n\n$39.7’den ise fiyat nizami bir yükseliş yakalayarak an itibariyle %13.6 kâr ile devam ediyor.\n\nHer iki işlem kurgusunu da düşünen birinin an itibariyle %7.6 kârının olması gerekiyordu. Daha fazla risk almamak adına kâr alıp, stop’u entry’e taşımayı düşünebilirsiniz.\n\nBenim Aksiyonum:\nÜstte bahsettiğim gibi, ilk pozisyonu kapatıp 2. alım yerinden işlem aldığım için ve şu aşamada LTF’deki dirence gelmemiz sebebiyle %50 kâr realize ediyorum, stop’u entry’e taşıyorum. \nMavi kutu kaybedilmediği müddetçe pozisyonda sıkıntı bulunmuyor.\n\nYeni Fikirler:\nFiyat kanalı kaybederse genel anlamda momentum kaybı yaşayacağını düşüneceğim. Bu bağlamda daha önceki analizde bahsettiğim üzere $28 civarları bir diğer alım düşüneceğim kısım olacaktır.\n\nPozitif ilerleyişin devamlılığı olursa $51-52 arasından pozisyonumu finalize edeceğim.\n\nHerkese güzel bir hafta sonu ve trade'lerinde başarılar dilerim.",entity_set:$R[205]={__ref:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set"},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA="},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set":$R[206]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set",__typename:"EntitySet",hashtags:$R[207]={__refs:$R[208]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:hashtags:0"]},symbols:$R[209]={__refs:$R[210]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:symbols:0"]},smarttags:null,urls:$R[211]={__refs:$R[212]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:urls:0","client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:urls:1"]},user_mentions:$R[213]={__refs:$R[214]=[]}},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:hashtags:0":$R[215]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:hashtags:0",__typename:"ApiTagEntity",indices:$R[216]=[1281,1286],text:"HYPE"},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:symbols:0":$R[217]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:symbols:0",__typename:"ApiTagEntity",indices:$R[218]=[0,5],tag:$R[219]={__ref:"U21hcnRUYWc6SFlQRQ=="},text:"HYPE"},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:urls:0":$R[220]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:urls:0",__typename:"UrlsEntity",display_url:"x.com/EfloudTheSurfe…",expanded_url:"https://x.com/EfloudTheSurfer/status/1970124416471408642",indices:$R[221]=[266,289],url:"https://t.co/chWj43wSIP"},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:urls:1":$R[222]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzE5NjAyMzI2MjU1NDExMjA=:entity_set:urls:1",__typename:"UrlsEntity",display_url:"x.com/EfloudTheSurfe…",expanded_url:"https://x.com/Eflo